+---
+type: Specification
+title: A post’s language
+description: How the site chooses a translation for a post.
+---
+
+# A post’s language
+
+## Available locales
+
+The author supplies the list of translations for each post. Readers can request
+a language that is absent from this list.
+
+## Unmatched preferences
+
+When no requested locale matches exactly or by language, show the translation
+for the post's default locale. If that translation is missing, return the
+not-found page, even when a translation in some other language exists.
